Description: Use Parcel's integer boolean representation before API 29
 Flat Headset supports API 24. Parcel.writeBoolean/readBoolean require API 29;
 use the same integer representation without calling those newer methods.
 Preserve the parcel field order and both boolean values in nested settings.
Author: Daniel Campos Ramos <Capitain_Jack@yahoo.com>
Origin: other, Flat Headset Android compatibility work
Forwarded: no
Last-Update: 2026-11-02

